@startuml seq-mf02-affiliate-referral
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title MF-02 · Affiliate refers a candidate (duplicate check and consent request)
actor "Affiliate" as AF
boundary "Web App" as FE
boundary "JobEndpoints" as API
control "SubmitCandidateCommandHandler" as H
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
cloud "Cloudflare R2" as R2
cloud "Resend" as MAIL
AF -> FE : Referral form + CV file
FE -> API : POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/candidate-submissions
API -> H : Send(SubmitCandidateCommand)
H -> R2 : Upload CV (validated PDF)
H -> DB : Find candidate by normalised e-mail / phone
alt same candidate already in this job or consent pending
H -> DB : Submission BLOCKED_DUPLICATE, keep first attribution
API --> FE : 409 BLOCKED_DUPLICATE
else new for this job
H -> DB : Submission PENDING_CONSENT + SubmissionConsent (token hash, expiry)
H -> MAIL : Consent e-mail through outbox
API --> FE : 201 Created
end
@enduml
